        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "FOR SALE – Prime Investment Opportunity, Main Street, Longford\r\n\r\nSubstantial town-center property extending to approximately 5,400 sq. ft. (501.6 sq. m.) with full planning permission for 6 residential apartments and 1 commercial unit.\r\n\r\nThe approved accommodation comprises:\r\nGround Floor\r\n\r\n    Commercial unit – approx. 136 sq. m.\r\n    2-bedroom apartment – approx. 64 sq. m.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\n    2-bedroom apartment – approx. 64 sq. m.\r\n    1-bedroom apartment – approx. 47 sq. m.\r\n    2-bedroom apartment – approx. 86 sq. m.\r\n\r\nSecond Floor\r\n\r\n    1-bedroom apartment – approx. 45 sq. m.\r\n    Studio apartment – approx. 43 sq. m.\r\n\r\nLocated on Main Street in the heart of Longford town, this property presents an excellent opportunity for investors and developers seeking a ready-to-go mixed-use scheme in a high-profile location.\r\n\r\nWith full planning permission already in place for the development this offers strong potential for rental income from both the residential and commercial elements.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n    Approx. 5,400 sq. ft. (501.6 sq. m.) building\r\n    Full planning permission granted\r\n    6 residential units and 1 commercial unit\r\n    Prime Main Street location\r\n    Excellent investment and development potential\r\n    Town-center setting with easy access to all amenities\r\n\r\nViewing and further details available on request."
      },
